{"seq":1,"slug":"smart-home-integration","title":"智能家居集成与安全策略","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/horizontal-pillars/automation-workflows/smart-home-integration","wordCount":1457,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"智能家居集成与安全策略\">智能家居集成与安全策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Personal-agent 接入智能家居（HomeKit / Home Assistant）是 Tier 2 工具栈&quot;生活自动化&quot;价值的入口——让 agent 根据日程、IM 消息、用户状态自动调灯 / 温控 / 门锁 / 摄像头。但 home automation 远比纯 software action 危险：误调温控、误锁门、误开摄像头都有实际后果。本篇按&quot;两套主流平台 + 设备状态访问 + 安全策略 + persona-aware 触发&quot;四块讲清。安全策略部分是重点——比集成本身更需要严格设计。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  AG[&quot;Personal-agent&quot;] --&gt; SP[&quot;安全策略层&quot;]&#10;  SP --&gt; HK[&quot;HomeKit Bridge&quot;]&#10;  SP --&gt; HA[&quot;Home Assistant API&quot;]&#10;  HK --&gt; DEV1[&quot;Apple-only devices&quot;]&#10;  HA --&gt; DEV2[&quot;MQTT / Zigbee / Z-Wave / WiFi devices&quot;]&#10;  AG -. persona check .-&gt; SP&#10;  AG -. time window .-&gt; SP&#10;  AG -. user confirm .-&gt; SP\">flowchart LR\n  AG[\"Personal-agent\"] --&gt; SP[\"安全策略层\"]\n  SP --&gt; HK[\"HomeKit Bridge\"]\n  SP --&gt; HA[\"Home Assistant API\"]\n  HK --&gt; DEV1[\"Apple-only devices\"]\n  HA --&gt; DEV2[\"MQTT / Zigbee / Z-Wave / WiFi devices\"]\n  AG -. persona check .-&gt; SP\n  AG -. time window .-&gt; SP\n  AG -. user confirm .-&gt; SP</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>协议入口</th>\n<th>自托管</th>\n<th>E2E 加密</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HomeKit</td>\n<td>Apple 生态封闭</td>\n<td>HAP over local TCP</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Home Assistant</td>\n<td>跨平台开源</td>\n<td>REST + WS + MQTT</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>自配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Matter</td>\n<td>跨厂商联合标准</td>\n<td>IPv6 mesh + HAP/HA</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"homekit-apple-平台内的安全模型\">HomeKit：Apple 平台内的安全模型</h2><p>HomeKit 用 HAP（HomeKit Accessory Protocol）通信，设备直接与 Apple 设备配对，云端是可选的。Personal-agent 想接 HomeKit 必须通过 <strong>bridge</strong>——常见做法是用 Homebridge（Node 实现的 HAP server）或 Home Assistant 的 HomeKit Bridge 把 agent 暴露成 HAP accessory。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// Homebridge plugin 暴露 agent action&#10;const accessory = new Accessory(&#39;Personal Agent&#39;, uuid);&#10;accessory&#10;  .getService(Service.Switch)&#10;  .getCharacteristic(Characteristic.On)&#10;  .on(&#39;set&#39;, async (value, callback) =&gt; {&#10;    if (value === true) {&#10;      await agent.triggerScene(&#39;evening_focus&#39;);&#10;    }&#10;    callback();&#10;  });&#10;bridge.publish({ port: 51826, pincode: &#39;031-45-154&#39; });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Homebridge plugin 暴露 agent action</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> accessory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Accessory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Personal Agent'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, uuid);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">accessory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Service.Switch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getCharacteristic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Characteristic.On)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'set'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">callback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> agent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">triggerScene</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'evening_focus'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    callback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bridge.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ port: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">51826</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, pincode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'031-45-154'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><p>HomeKit 的 user-presence 与 device state 在 HAP 协议里以 characteristic 形式暴露——例如 <code>CurrentTemperature</code> / <code>LockTargetState</code>。Agent 通过 read characteristic 拿状态、write characteristic 改状态。所有通信只走本地 Wi-Fi——这是 HomeKit 的隐私优势，也意味着 agent 必须与 device 同子网。</p>\n<h2 id=\"home-assistant-跨平台开源-hub\">Home Assistant：跨平台开源 hub</h2><p>Home Assistant 是事实标准的开源 home hub，支持 1000+ 集成（MQTT / Zigbee2MQTT / Z-Wave JS / Tuya / Xiaomi 等）。Personal-agent 接 HA 走三类入口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import requests&#10;&#10;HA_URL = &quot;http://homeassistant.local:8123&quot;&#10;TOKEN = &quot;long-lived-access-token&quot;&#10;&#10;# REST: 读状态&#10;resp = requests.get(&#10;    f&quot;{HA_URL}/api/states/light.living_room&quot;,&#10;    headers={&quot;Authorization&quot;: f&quot;Bearer {TOKEN}&quot;},&#10;)&#10;state = resp.json()[&quot;state&quot;]  # &quot;on&quot; / &quot;off&quot;&#10;&#10;# REST: 服务调用&#10;requests.post(&#10;    f&quot;{HA_URL}/api/services/light/turn_on&quot;,&#10;    headers={&quot;Authorization&quot;: f&quot;Bearer {TOKEN}&quot;},&#10;    json={&quot;entity_id&quot;: &quot;light.living_room&quot;, &quot;brightness&quot;: 128},&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> requests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">HA_URL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"http://homeassistant.local:8123\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"long-lived-access-token\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># REST: 读状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">resp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> requests.get(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{HA_URL}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/api/states/light.living_room\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    headers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Authorization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bearer </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{TOKEN}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resp.json()[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># \"on\" / \"off\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># REST: 服务调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">requests.post(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{HA_URL}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/api/services/light/turn_on\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    headers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Authorization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bearer </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{TOKEN}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"entity_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"light.living_room\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"brightness\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>入口</th>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>实时</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>REST</td>\n<td>HTTP</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>one-shot 操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WebSocket</td>\n<td>WS</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>状态订阅 / 实时事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MQTT</td>\n<td>mqtt://</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>设备级直连</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>WebSocket 订阅是 personal-agent 监控家庭状态的核心——<code>state_changed</code> 事件流推送每次设备变化，agent 可基于此做出反应（如门锁 unlocked 时记录 audit、温度过低时调高）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"设备状态查询与变更-典型操作\">设备状态查询与变更：典型操作</h2><p>四大类家居设备的 query / mutate 操作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设备类型</th>\n<th>查询 entity</th>\n<th>变更 service</th>\n<th>安全等级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>灯</td>\n<td><code>light.&lt;room&gt;</code> → on/off + brightness</td>\n<td><code>light.turn_on/off</code></td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>温控</td>\n<td><code>climate.&lt;room&gt;</code> → temp/mode</td>\n<td><code>climate.set_temperature</code></td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门锁</td>\n<td><code>lock.&lt;door&gt;</code> → locked</td>\n<td><code>lock.lock/unlock</code></td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>摄像头</td>\n<td><code>camera.&lt;location&gt;</code> → recording</td>\n<td><code>camera.turn_on/off</code></td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>灯属于低风险——agent 可在用户登录工作 persona 后自动调到 work scene。温控是中风险——误操作可能让家里太冷/太热。门锁与摄像头是高风险——任何 unlock / 开监控都属于安全敏感操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全策略层-四层防护\">安全策略层：四层防护</h2><p>personal-agent 触发 home action 必须经过四层防护——任何一层失败都阻断：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  ACT[&quot;agent action&quot;] --&gt; L1[&quot;L1: persona 权限白名单&quot;]&#10;  L1 -- pass --&gt; L2[&quot;L2: 时间窗约束&quot;]&#10;  L2 -- pass --&gt; L3[&quot;L3: 设备危险等级阈值&quot;]&#10;  L3 -- pass --&gt; L4[&quot;L4: user confirm 必要性&quot;]&#10;  L4 -- pass --&gt; EX[&quot;执行&quot;]&#10;  L4 -- block --&gt; NTF[&quot;通知用户&quot;]&#10;  L3 -- block --&gt; AUD[&quot;audit log&quot;]&#10;  L2 -- block --&gt; AUD&#10;  L1 -- block --&gt; AUD\">flowchart TD\n  ACT[\"agent action\"] --&gt; L1[\"L1: persona 权限白名单\"]\n  L1 -- pass --&gt; L2[\"L2: 时间窗约束\"]\n  L2 -- pass --&gt; L3[\"L3: 设备危险等级阈值\"]\n  L3 -- pass --&gt; L4[\"L4: user confirm 必要性\"]\n  L4 -- pass --&gt; EX[\"执行\"]\n  L4 -- block --&gt; NTF[\"通知用户\"]\n  L3 -- block --&gt; AUD[\"audit log\"]\n  L2 -- block --&gt; AUD\n  L1 -- block --&gt; AUD</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>block 行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1</td>\n<td>当前 persona 是否在 home action 白名单</td>\n<td>reject + audit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2</td>\n<td>当前时间是否在允许窗口</td>\n<td>delay / reject</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3</td>\n<td>设备风险等级是否需要 confirm</td>\n<td>弹 confirm + audit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4</td>\n<td>用户是否显式 confirm（OTP / push）</td>\n<td>等待 confirm / 超时 reject</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>L1 与 L4 经常配合：work persona 可直接调灯 + 温控（L4 跳过），但门锁 unlock 必须 hobby_home persona 在场 + L4 confirm。</p>\n<h2 id=\"persona-aware-actions\">Persona-aware actions</h2><p>不同 persona 对应不同的&quot;角色场景&quot;——personal-agent 工作时段下用 <code>work_focus</code> persona、晚上用 <code>home_relax</code> persona。Home action 白名单按 persona 区分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"personas:&#10;  work_focus:&#10;    home_actions:&#10;      allow:&#10;        - light.work_room.* # 工作房灯&#10;        - climate.work_room.set # 工作房温控&#10;      deny:&#10;        - lock.* # 工作中不应解锁门&#10;        - camera.* # 工作中不应开摄像头&#10;&#10;  home_relax:&#10;    home_actions:&#10;      allow:&#10;        - light.* # 全屋灯&#10;        - climate.*&#10;      deny:&#10;        - lock.front_door.unlock # 即使家用 persona 也要 confirm&#10;      require_confirm:&#10;        - camera.*\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">personas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  work_focus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    home_actions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      allow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">light.work_room.*</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 工作房灯</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">climate.work_room.set</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 工作房温控</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      deny</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">lock.*</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 工作中不应解锁门</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">camera.*</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 工作中不应开摄像头</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  home_relax</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    home_actions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      allow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">light.*</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 全屋灯</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">climate.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      deny</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">lock.front_door.unlock</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 即使家用 persona 也要 confirm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      require_confirm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">camera.*</span></span></code></pre></div><p>work persona 在白天误触发&quot;unlock front door&quot;——L1 直接 reject 因为 unlock 不在 work allow 列表里。这种&quot;以 persona 为安全边界&quot;的设计比单纯写&quot;用户身份&quot;更细——同一个用户在不同时段下的权限就该不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间窗约束-深夜禁危险操作\">时间窗约束：深夜禁危险操作</h2><p>时间窗约束在 L2 检查：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>允许时间窗</th>\n<th>例外处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>调灯</td>\n<td>任何时间</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调温控</td>\n<td>06:00–24:00</td>\n<td>深夜 reject</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门锁 lock</td>\n<td>任何时间</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门锁 unlock</td>\n<td>06:00–22:00 + confirm</td>\n<td>深夜双重 confirm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>摄像头 turn on</td>\n<td>仅离家 (away 状态)</td>\n<td>在家 reject</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>深夜（0–6 时）大部分操作 reject——agent 既不应该在用户睡觉时突然调温控，也不应该让任何人在深夜远程 unlock 门。这层约束硬编码在 OpenClaw 默认配置，用户可显式覆盖（但必须 explicit override）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"user-confirm-必要性\">User confirm 必要性</h2><p>L4 confirm 走两种 channel：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>confirm 通道</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Push (APNs / FCM)</td>\n<td>&lt; 5s</td>\n<td>紧急</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IM 私信</td>\n<td>&lt; 30s</td>\n<td>计划性操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TOTP / OTP</td>\n<td>输入即时</td>\n<td>极高敏感</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Push 是默认——agent 触发 unlock 时立刻发 push：&quot;Confirm unlock front door? [Allow] [Deny]&quot;。用户 30 秒内不响应视为 deny（fail-secure）。极高敏感操作（如重置家庭网络密码、解锁全部摄像头）走 TOTP——用户输 6 位码才执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-cron-im-触发的协议关系\">与 cron / IM 触发的协议关系</h2><p>Home action 不只来自用户对话，也可能由本章第 2 / 3 篇讲的 <a href=\"cron-and-scheduled-tasks\"><code>./2_cron-and-scheduled-tasks.md</code></a> 与 <a href=\"im-triggered-automation\"><code>./3_im-triggered-automation.md</code></a> 触发——例如 cron &quot;每晚 23:30 关全屋灯&quot;、IM <code>/home goodnight</code> 命令。无论触发源是什么，都走相同的四层防护——不能因为是 cron 触发就跳过 persona 权限校验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>HomeKit 跨子网失败</strong>：HAP 走 mDNS，agent 必须与设备在同子网。VPN / 容器网络常导致设备不可见。</li>\n<li><strong>HA token 长期不轮换</strong>：long-lived access token 默认无过期。token 泄露后整个家暴露——建议每季度轮换。</li>\n<li><strong>WebSocket 重连不处理</strong>：HA 重启或 wifi 飘移时 WS 断开，agent 未实现重连会错过事件。SDK 必须有 exponential backoff 重连。</li>\n<li><strong>persona 白名单写 <code>*.*</code></strong>：figure 简洁但开过大权限。白名单永远显式列 entity pattern。</li>\n<li><strong>深夜窗口未考虑跨时区</strong>：用户出差到不同时区，深夜窗口仍按原时区计算可能错位。基于设备本地时区或用户当前时区都可，但要在 audit 里标清。</li>\n<li><strong>confirm push 失败静默通过</strong>：push 服务挂了视为&quot;deny&quot;而不是&quot;allow&quot;——fail-secure 是 home action 的强约束。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>智能家居集成把 personal-agent 的能力延伸到物理世界，HomeKit / Home Assistant 是两套主流入口。集成本身不难，难的是安全策略——四层防护（persona 白名单 → 时间窗 → 风险等级 → user confirm）把误触发风险压到可控。深夜禁危险、unlock 必 confirm、push fail-secure 三条是默认必备。下一篇讲 cron 周期任务如何与 hooks transform 管线协同。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"智能家居集成与安全策略","id":"智能家居集成与安全策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"HomeKit：Apple 平台内的安全模型","id":"homekit-apple-平台内的安全模型"},{"level":2,"text":"Home Assistant：跨平台开源 hub","id":"home-assistant-跨平台开源-hub"},{"level":2,"text":"设备状态查询与变更：典型操作","id":"设备状态查询与变更-典型操作"},{"level":2,"text":"安全策略层：四层防护","id":"安全策略层-四层防护"},{"level":2,"text":"Persona-aware actions","id":"persona-aware-actions"},{"level":2,"text":"时间窗约束：深夜禁危险操作","id":"时间窗约束-深夜禁危险操作"},{"level":2,"text":"User confirm 必要性","id":"user-confirm-必要性"},{"level":2,"text":"与 cron / IM 触发的协议关系","id":"与-cron-im-触发的协议关系"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Personas 与 channel 的绑定语义","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/horizontal-pillars/chat-platform-routing/personas-channel-binding"},"next":{"title":"Cron 周期任务与 hooks 协同","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/horizontal-pillars/automation-workflows/cron-and-scheduled-tasks"}}